Do not perform expensive deep research every day.

Use:

```text
Daily
→ lightweight signal detection

Weekly
→ deeper ecosystem analysis

Monthly
→ comprehensive strategic analysis
```

Escalate from lightweight to deep research only when a signal crosses a relevance threshold.

